04) Do "Dark Storms" (52.2, 43.2): Bring Fizzle's Claw to Orgnil Soulscar in Razor Hill.
05) Do "Encroachment" (42.8, 52.6): Kill 4 Razormane Quilboars, 4 Razormane Scouts, 4 Razormane Dustrunners and 4 Razormane...
