09) Turn in "Humbert's Sword" to Deathguard Humbert (61.6, 82.0).
10) Turn in "Helcular's Revenge" to Novice Thaivand (62.9, 81.4).
11) Turn in "Helcular's Revenge" to Helcular's Grave (56.1, 28.4).
