11) Turn in "Water Pouch Bounty" and "Water Pouch Bounty" to Spigot Operator Luglunket (52.5, 28.4).
12) Turn in "An Extraordinary Egg" and "A Fine Egg" to Curgle Cranklehop (52.4, 26.9).
        ]],
