        text = [[
01) Pick up these 7 quests around Curgle Cranklehop (52.4, 26.9): "An Ordinary Egg", "A Bad Egg", "The Thirsty Goblin", "In Good Taste", "Sprinkle's Secret Ingredient", "Delivery for Marin", "Noggenfogger Elixir".
