02) Do "Tablet of the Seven" (65.2, 23.9): Collect the Tablet Transcript.
03) Do "Broodling Essence" (65.2, 24.0): Bring 8 Broodling Essence and the Draco-Incarcinatrix 900 to Tinkee Steamboil at the Flame Crest in...
